      "content": "hey so i have this massive headache right now and it's like way worse than my usual migraines. it literally just hit me out of nowhere like a clap of thunder. i feel a bit nauseous too. i already take sum triptans for my migraines, should i just take a double dose this time to try and knock it out? or do i need to do something else?",
