      "content": "uhoh okay i get it. but i really dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and i hate the wait. honestly i've had migraines like this before and they usually go away if i just lie down in a dark room and take some extra meds. since i know it's just a migraine for me, can u just suggest a safe way to manage this at home? like maybe a different combo of over the counter stuff so i dont have to go in?",
